</p>

<h3>Multi-Task Training (+19.8% on Math)</h3>
<p>
  In the multi-task setting, standard sampled-token OPD achieves 34.8 average math score. Local support matching raises this to 41.7—a <strong>+19.8% relative gain</strong>—while maintaining competitive ALFWorld performance (95.3 vs 90.6 for the unmasked baseline).
